# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Deliberately minimal. We do NOT set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy /
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: the app loads ONNX Runtime Web + Transformers.js
# from jsdelivr and streams model weights from huggingface.co, and COEP:
# require-corp would break those cross-origin fetches. draw.instant uses the
# WebGPU execution path (not threaded WASM / SharedArrayBuffer), so cross-origin
# isolation buys nothing here.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: browsing-topics=()
